  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/09/IMG_0215.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>En la calle San Bernardo, 10 de Onda ha abierto sus puertas la tarde de este lunes la tienda La Gourmet, especializada en bacalao, salm&oacute;n, salazones, aceite, aceitunas, vinos y cava. Todos los s&aacute;bados habr&aacute; degustaci&oacute;n de productos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciolagourmetonda/img_0215.jpg\" alt=\"img_0215\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciolagourmetonda/img_0216.jpg\" alt=\"img_0216\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciolagourmetonda/img_0217.jpg\" alt=\"img_0217\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciolagourmetonda/img_0218.jpg\" alt=\"img_0218\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciolagourmetonda/img_0219.jpg\" alt=\"img_0219\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciolagourmetonda/img_0220.jpg\" alt=\"img_0220\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciolagourmetonda/img_0221.jpg\" alt=\"img_0221\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciolagourmetonda/img_0222.jpg\" alt=\"img_0222\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciolagourmetonda/img_0223.jpg\" alt=\"img_0223\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d